# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
# A project-local pnpm store, if one gets created here.
.pnpm-store
# Personal working notes, e.g. TODO.local.md.
*.local.md
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Environment files. `*.local` above already covers `.env.local`, but a plain
# `.env` is where secrets usually end up. Note that Vite inlines any `VITE_`
# prefixed variable into the client bundle, so those are public by definition.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# Ladle's production build output.
build

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Vitest. Failure screenshots and visual diffs land under .vitest/attachments.
# Visual baselines are NOT ignored: __screenshots__/ is committed on purpose,
# because the baseline is the assertion.
.vitest/
